<title>PAPUA NEW GUINEA: RTRS-Bougainville Copper H1 net profit dips.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bougainville Copper H1 net profit dips.</headline>
<dateline>PORT MORESBY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million kina unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     3.55 vs 4.91</p>
<p>    Net					3.55 vs 4.91</p>
<p>    Interest income			6.11 vs 1.86</p>
<p>    Tax					 nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Bougainville Copper Ltd's main asset is the Panguna copper mine which has been closed since May 1989 by a secessionist rebellion on the Papua New Guinea island. It is 53.6 percent owned by RTZ Corp Plc-CRA Ltd. All its income is now interest income.</p>
</text>
